## Scenarios

### Types Spec

#### basic type literals

- Verify: basic type literals
   - Expected: s equals `hello`
   - Expected: i equals `42`
   - Expected: b is true


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 10 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: basic type literals")
# String, integer, boolean, float literals
val s = "hello"
val i = 42
val b = true
val f = 3.14
expect(s).to_equal("hello")
expect(i).to_equal(42)
expect(b).to_equal(true)
```

</details>

